# Testing Rules (.mdc)

- **Unit Testing:** Write comprehensive unit tests for all financial calculation Use Cases (partial payments, extra donation routing, multi-month allocations) using JUnit 5 and MockK.
- **Instrumented & UI Testing:** Verify Room DAOs and key Jetpack Compose UI screens.
- **Test-Driven Refinement:** Run type-check, lint, and unit tests after implementing each feature slice.
